.LSOverride

# Build outputs (Gradle / Maven / Eclipse)
**/build/
**/bin/
**/target/
**/out/
**/.gradle/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.tar
*.zip

# Eclipse / IDE metadata
**/.classpath
**/.project
